<title>POLAND: KRUSZWICA MARCH NET FALLS TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>KRUSZWICA MARCH NET FALLS TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MARCH		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.53 vs   3.18</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.53 vs   5.85</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.01 vs   7.31</p>
<p> Sales		   42.66 vs  43.60</p>
<p> JANUARY-MARCH	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.69 vs   6.27</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.85 vs  12.63</p>
<p> Operating profit     6.55 vs  18.63</p>
<p> Sales		  128.78 vs 140.04</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish edible fats producer is</p>
<p>Zaklady Tluszczowe Kruszwica SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
